        "original_id": "b6440239-9375-5b05-b36e-31086f24fdb4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sinbad, David Adkins, Brian Robbins, Kenan Thompson, Kel Mitchell\n- Roles: comedian, actor, musician, director\n- Works: HBO specials, Necessary Roughness, Houseguest, First Kid, Jingle All the Way, Good Burger, All That, Kenan & Kel\n- Topics: American entertainment, 1990s film and television\n\nFacts:\n- David Adkins was born on November 10, 1956, and he is better known by the stage name Sinbad.\n- Sinbad is an American stand-up comedian, actor, and musician.\n- In the 1990s, Sinbad became known through his own HBO specials, appearances on several television series, and starring roles in Necessary Roughness, Houseguest, First Kid, Jingle All the Way, and Good Burger.\n- Good Burger is a 1997 American comedy film directed by Brian Robbins.\n- Good Burger stars Kenan Thompson and Kel Mitchell, who were stars of All That and Kenan & Kel.",
